            "detailed_description": "Race your fast-paced racing car on specially prepared tracks in <strong>VR Drivers </strong>game. Sit in your chair, put on the goggles of virtual reality, grip the steering wheel and feel like a real driver. Race with computer opponents and improve your race record.<br><br>The game uses <strong>Oculus Rift</strong> and <strong>HTC Vive</strong> technology, <strong>Logitech G29 Driving Force</strong> steering wheel, but there is also the possibility of playing with <strong>Xbox/XInput gamepad</strong>.<br><br>The gameplay consists of finishing a race on three fully original tracks.<br><br>Persons with vision defects, to take part in the game, should take care to wear contact lenses.",
